Here is the complete product landing page UI tailored to your brief. 

I have created two A2UI messages:
1. **Create Surface**: Registers the new `product-landing-page` surface with the corresponding marketing/commerce catalog.
2. **Update Components**: Defines the page structure. It uses a single-column `columns` layout as the `root` container to hold the vertical stack of landing page components: a **Gradient Hero**, a 3-column **Feature Grid**, a rich **Testimonial Card**, and a high-converting **CTA Section** banner with action buttons.

### Step 1: Create the Surface
First, we initialize the UI surface with the rendering client.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "createSurface": {
    "surfaceId": "product-landing-page",
    "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/c-marketing-commerce.json"
  }
}
</a2ui-json>

### Step 2: Render the Components
Next, we send the component tree defining the layout and content.

<a2ui-json>
{
  "version": "v0.9.1",
  "updateComponents": {
    "surfaceId": "product-landing-page",
    "components": [
      {
        "id": "root",
        "component": "columns",
        "cols": 1,
        "items": [
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "hero-section",
                "component": "gradient_hero",
                "title": "Supercharge Your Engineering Workflow",
                "subtitle": "The complete developer platform to design, build, and deploy modern applications globally with zero friction.",
                "badge": "Now in public beta",
                "cta_label": "Get Started Free",
                "cta_url": "https://example.com/signup"
              },
              {
                "id": "features-section",
                "component": "feature_grid",
                "heading": "Engineered for high-performance teams",
                "description": "Get production-ready infrastructure, stellar developer experience, and global scale right out of the box.",
                "columns": 3,
                "features": [
                  {
                    "icon": "⚡",
                    "title": "Lightning Performance",
                    "description": "Globally distributed edge runtime ensures your applications respond instantly to every user.",
                    "badge": "Fast",
                    "color": "#3b82f6"
                  },
                  {
                    "icon": "🛡️",
                    "title": "Enterprise Security",
                    "description": "Built-in DDoS protection, automatic SSL certificates, and strict encryption protocols active 24/7.",
                    "badge": "Secure",
                    "color": "#10b981"
                  },
                  {
                    "icon": "📈",
                    "title": "Unified Analytics",
                    "description": "Real-time insights, error tracking, and performance metrics to monitor your product continuous health.",
                    "badge": "Insights",
                    "color": "#8b5cf6"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "testimonial-section",
                "component": "testimonial_card",
                "text": "This platform completely revolutionized our delivery pipeline. We went from bi-weekly releases to continuous, automated deployments with absolute confidence.",
                "author_name": "Sarah Jenkins",
                "author_title": "VP of Engineering at CloudTech",
                "author_avatar_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&h=150&q=80",
                "rating": 5
              },
              {
                "id": "cta-section",
                "component": "cta_section",
                "heading": "Ready to build the future?",
                "body": "Join thousands of developers and teams shipping faster, more reliable web applications today.",
                "primary_cta": {
                  "label": "Start Building",
                  "url": "https://example.com/get-started"
                },
                "secondary_cta": {
                  "label": "Talk to Sales",
                  "url": "https://example.com/sales"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
</a2ui-json>
